        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "<ul>\n\t<li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">A <a href=\"/Maganszemelyek.html/digitalis_bank/eBroker/eBroker-belfoldi.html\">hazai tőzsd&eacute;n<\/a> jegyzett r&eacute;szv&eacute;nyek, certifik&aacute;tok, befektet&eacute;si jegyek, hitelpap&iacute;rok &eacute;s a <a href=\"/Maganszemelyek.html/digitalis_bank/eBroker/eBroker-befektetesi-alapok.html\">CIB Befektet&eacute;si Alapkezelő befektet&eacute;si jegyeinek<\/a> ad&aacute;sv&eacute;tele.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Az <a href=\"/Maganszemelyek.html/digitalis_bank/eBroker/eBroker-befektetesi-alapok.html\">Eurizon Easy Funds befektet&eacute;si jegyek<\/a> ad&aacute;sv&eacute;tele.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Bankunk &aacute;ltal forgalmazott &aacute;llampap&iacute;rok &eacute;s bankunk &aacute;ltal kibocs&aacute;tott k&ouml;tv&eacute;nyek ad&aacute;sv&eacute;tele.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Megl&eacute;vő <a href=\"/Maganszemelyek.html/digitalis_bank/eBroker/eBroker-nyesz.html\">nyugd&iacute;j-előtakar&eacute;koss&aacute;gi &eacute;rt&eacute;kpap&iacute;rsz&aacute;ml&aacute;n<\/a> t&ouml;rt&eacute;nő keresked&eacute;s.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><a href=\"/Maganszemelyek.html/megtakaritasok/maraton_tbsz_szamlak.html\">CIB Maraton (Tart&oacute;s Befektet&eacute;si Sz&aacute;mla) &eacute;rt&eacute;kpap&iacute;r-sz&aacute;ml&aacute;n<\/a> t&ouml;rt&eacute;nő keresked&eacute;s.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Keresked&eacute;si lehetős&eacute;g 10 <a href=\"/Maganszemelyek.html/digitalis_bank/eBroker/eBroker-kulfoldi.html\">k&uuml;lf&ouml;ldi piac tőzsd&eacute;in<\/a>.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Rugalmas előfizet&eacute;si lehetős&eacute;g tőzsdei &quot;real-time&quot; &aacute;rfolyamokra.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Naprak&eacute;sz inform&aacute;ci&oacute;k a sz&aacute;ml&aacute;n tartott &eacute;rt&eacute;kpap&iacute;r &eacute;s k&eacute;szp&eacute;nz&aacute;llom&aacute;nyr&oacute;l.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">A m&uacute;ltbeli megb&iacute;z&aacute;sok &eacute;s p&eacute;nzsz&aacute;mla-t&ouml;rt&eacute;net lek&eacute;rdez&eacute;se.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">A m&eacute;g nem teljes&uuml;lt tőzsdei megb&iacute;z&aacute;sok visszavon&aacute;s&aacute;nak lehetős&eacute;ge.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Befektet&eacute;si &uuml;gyf&eacute;lsz&aacute;ml&aacute;r&oacute;l forint &aacute;tvezet&eacute;se banksz&aacute;ml&aacute;ra.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Deviza konverzi&oacute; befektet&eacute;si &uuml;gyf&eacute;lsz&aacute;mla terh&eacute;re.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n"
        }
      }
      ,
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Ki tudom próbálni?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "<p><strong>Ki tudom pr&oacute;b&aacute;lni a keresked&eacute;si fel&uuml;letet egy demo alkalmaz&aacute;ssal?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Igen,<\/strong>&nbsp;a&nbsp;dem&oacute; verzi&oacute;ban a funkci&oacute;kat norm&aacute;l műk&ouml;d&eacute;s&eacute;ben tekintheti meg, de az itt megadott tranzakci&oacute;k nem ker&uuml;lnek teljes&iacute;t&eacute;sre. Ind&iacute;tsa el a <a href=\"https://ebroker.cib.hu/ebrdemo/\" target=\"_blank\">demo verzi&oacute;t<\/a> a port&aacute;lon!<\/p>\n"
        }
      }
      ,
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Hogyan lehetek én is eBroker felhasználó?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "<ol>\n\t<li>Az ig&eacute;nyl&eacute;shez:\n\t<ol>\n\t\t<li>k&eacute;rjen visszah&iacute;v&aacute;st,<\/li>\n\t\t<li>f&aacute;radjon be b&aacute;rmely <a href=\"/Maganszemelyek.html/leave-message/branch.html\">CIB bankfi&oacute;kba<\/a>, ak&aacute;r <a href=\"/Maganszemelyek.html/leave-message/book-appointment.html\">időpontot is foglalhat<\/a>.<\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<\/li>\n\t<li>K&ouml;sse meg a befektet&eacute;si sz&aacute;mla vezet&eacute;s&eacute;re vonatkoz&oacute; keretszerződ&eacute;st, illetve az internetes keresked&eacute;sre vonatkoz&oacute; szerződ&eacute;s-kieg&eacute;sz&iacute;t&eacute;st.<\/li>\n\t<li>A szerződ&eacute;sk&ouml;t&eacute;st k&ouml;vetően megkapja felhaszn&aacute;l&oacute; nev&eacute;t, mellyel azonnal bel&eacute;phet az eBroker rendszerbe.<\/li>\n\t<li>Ezt k&ouml;vetően befektet&eacute;si &uuml;gyeit teljes k&ouml;rűen int&eacute;zheti az interneten kereszt&uuml;l.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Sz&aacute;mlanyit&aacute;shoz sz&uuml;ks&eacute;ges dokumentumok<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p>A keretszerződ&eacute;s megk&ouml;t&eacute;s&eacute;hez &Ouml;nnek mag&aacute;val kell hoznia az al&aacute;bbi dokumentumokat: Mag&aacute;nszem&eacute;lyek eset&eacute;n<\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Szem&eacute;lyi azonos&iacute;t&aacute;sra alkalmas arck&eacute;pes k&ouml;zokiratot<\/li>\n\t<li>Lakc&iacute;met igazol&oacute; hat&oacute;s&aacute;gi igazolv&aacute;nyt**<\/li>\n\t<li>Ad&oacute;igazolv&aacute;nyt<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p>Jogi szem&eacute;lyek &eacute;s jogi szem&eacute;lyis&eacute;g n&eacute;lk&uuml;li egy&eacute;b szervezetek eset&eacute;n<\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Ad&oacute;bejelentkez&eacute;si lapot<\/li>\n\t<li>Egy h&oacute;napn&aacute;l nem r&eacute;gebbi c&eacute;gkivonat ill. hat&oacute;s&aacute;gi nyilv&aacute;ntart&aacute;sba v&eacute;telt elrendelő v&eacute;gz&eacute;st*** vagy alap&iacute;t&oacute; okiratot ****<\/li>\n\t<li>Al&aacute;&iacute;r&aacute;sra jogosultak al&aacute;&iacute;r&aacute;si c&iacute;mp&eacute;ld&aacute;nya<\/li>\n\t<li>Banksz&aacute;mlasz&aacute;m<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p><em>** amennyiben az a. pont szerinti okirat ezt nem tartalmazza<br />\n*** az 1997:CXLV.tr. hat&aacute;lya al&aacute; nem tartoz&oacute; jogalany eset&eacute;n<br />\n**** ha a b&iacute;r&oacute;s&aacute;g az adott szervezetet nyilv&aacute;ntart&aacute;sba nem veszi<\/em><\/p>\n"
        }
      }
      ,
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Kondíciók",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "<table class=\"table table-responsive table-hover table-striped\">\n\t<tbody style=\"padding:0px; border:0px; outline:none 0px; vertical-align:top; background:transparent; display:table; width:694px\">\n\t\t<tr style=\"padding:0px; border:0px; outline:none 0px; vertical-align:top; background:transparent\">\n\t\t\t<td bgcolor=\"#fef5e3\" class=\"block-title\" height=\"45\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:linear-gradient(#019052, #005b35); padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top; margin-top:5px; margin-right:4px; margin-bottom:2px; margin-left:4px\" width=\"190\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Verdana, Tahoma\"><span style=\"color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">&nbsp;D&iacute;jcsomagok<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fcf0d7\" class=\"block-title\" height=\"45\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:linear-gradient(#019052, #005b35); padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top; margin-top:5px; margin-right:4px; margin-bottom:2px; margin-left:4px\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Verdana, Tahoma\"><span style=\"color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">&nbsp;STANDARD<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fcf0d7\" class=\"block-title\" height=\"45\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:linear-gradient(#019052, #005b35); padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top; margin-top:5px; margin-right:4px; margin-bottom:2px; margin-left:4px\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Verdana, Tahoma\"><span style=\"color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">MAG&Aacute;NBEFEKTETŐI&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fcf0d7\" class=\"block-title\" height=\"45\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:linear-gradient(#019052, #005b35); padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top; margin-top:5px; margin-right:4px; margin-bottom:2px; margin-left:4px\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Verdana, Tahoma\"><span style=\"color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">&Uuml;ZLETI&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr style=\"padding:0px; border:0px; outline:none 0px; vertical-align:top; background:transparent\">\n\t\t\t<td bgcolor=\"#fef5e3\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"45\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"190\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">A prompt r&eacute;szv&eacute;nypiaci adatok 15 perces k&eacute;sleltet&eacute;ssel<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fcf0d7\" height=\"45\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">&nbsp;<img class=\"simple\" src=\"https://net.cib.hu/%5Eupload/ebroker/condition_yes_yellow.gif\" style=\"padding:0px; border:0px; outline:none 0px; vertical-align:middle; background:transparent; max-width:none\" /><\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fcf0d7\" height=\"45\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">&nbsp;<img class=\"simple\" src=\"https://net.cib.hu/%5Eupload/ebroker/condition_no_yellow.gif\" style=\"padding:0px; border:0px; outline:none 0px; vertical-align:middle; background:transparent; max-width:none\" /><\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fcf0d7\" height=\"45\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">&nbsp;<img class=\"simple\" src=\"https://net.cib.hu/%5Eupload/ebroker/condition_no_yellow.gif\" style=\"padding:0px; border:0px; outline:none 0px; vertical-align:middle; background:transparent; max-width:none\" /><\/span><\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr style=\"padding:0px; border:0px; outline:none 0px; vertical-align:top; background:transparent\">\n\t\t\t<td bgcolor=\"#f3f6f9\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"190\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">Real-time adatok kieg&eacute;sz&iacute;tve az 5 legjobb v&eacute;teli &eacute;s a legjobb elad&aacute;si aj&aacute;nlat megjelen&iacute;t&eacute;s&eacute;vel<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#e5ecf3\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">&nbsp;<img class=\"simple\" src=\"https://net.cib.hu/%5Eupload/ebroker/condition_no_blue.gif\" style=\"padding:0px; border:0px; outline:none 0px; vertical-align:middle; background:transparent; max-width:none\" /><\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#e5ecf3\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">&nbsp;<img class=\"simple\" src=\"https://net.cib.hu/%5Eupload/ebroker/condition_yes_blue.gif\" style=\"padding:0px; border:0px; outline:none 0px; vertical-align:middle; background:transparent; max-width:none\" /><\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#e5ecf3\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">&nbsp;<img class=\"simple\" src=\"https://net.cib.hu/%5Eupload/ebroker/condition_yes_blue.gif\" style=\"padding:0px; border:0px; outline:none 0px; vertical-align:middle; background:transparent; max-width:none\" /><\/span><\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr style=\"padding:0px; border:0px; outline:none 0px; vertical-align:top; background:transparent\">\n\t\t\t<td bgcolor=\"#fef5e3\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"190\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">Sz&aacute;mlavezet&eacute;s havi d&iacute;ja<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fcf0d7\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">330Ft/h&oacute;<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fcf0d7\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">330Ft/h&oacute;<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fcf0d7\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">330Ft/h&oacute;<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr style=\"padding:0px; border:0px; outline:none 0px; vertical-align:top; background:transparent\">\n\t\t\t<td bgcolor=\"#f3f6f9\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"190\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">Emeltszintű szolg&aacute;ltat&aacute;s d&iacute;ja *<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#e5ecf3\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">&nbsp;<img class=\"simple\" src=\"https://net.cib.hu/%5Eupload/ebroker/condition_no_blue.gif\" style=\"padding:0px; border:0px; outline:none 0px; vertical-align:middle; background:transparent; max-width:none\" /><\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#e5ecf3\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">2500Ft/h&oacute;<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#e5ecf3\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">7000Ft/h&oacute;<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr style=\"padding:0px; border:0px; outline:none 0px; vertical-align:top; background:transparent\">\n\t\t\t<td bgcolor=\"#fef5e3\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"190\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">Az emeltszitű szolg. d&iacute;jb&oacute;l maxim&aacute;lisan letőzsd&eacute;zhető<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fcf0d7\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">&nbsp;<img class=\"simple\" src=\"https://net.cib.hu/%5Eupload/ebroker/condition_no_yellow.gif\" style=\"padding:0px; border:0px; outline:none 0px; vertical-align:middle; background:transparent; max-width:none\" /><\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fcf0d7\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">1000Ft/h&oacute;<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fcf0d7\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">1000Ft/h&oacute;<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr style=\"padding:0px; border:0px; outline:none 0px; vertical-align:top; background:transparent\">\n\t\t\t<td bgcolor=\"#f3f6f9\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"190\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">Jutal&eacute;k m&eacute;rt&eacute;ke (megb&iacute;z&aacute;sonk&eacute;nt)<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#e5ecf3\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">0,55%<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#e5ecf3\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">0,4%<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#e5ecf3\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">0,4%<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr style=\"padding:0px; border:0px; outline:none 0px; vertical-align:top; background:transparent\">\n\t\t\t<td bgcolor=\"#fef5e3\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"190\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">Minim&aacute;lis jutal&eacute;k megb&iacute;z&aacute;sonk&eacute;nt<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fcf0d7\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">150Ft<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fcf0d7\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">150Ft<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fcf0d7\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">300Ft<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr style=\"padding:0px; border:0px; outline:none 0px; vertical-align:top; background:transparent\">\n\t\t\t<td bgcolor=\"#f3f6f9\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"190\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">Day-trade d&iacute;j&nbsp;(Norm&aacute;l, TDayTrade)<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#e5ecf3\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">0,275%<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#e5ecf3\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">0,2%<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#e5ecf3\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"83\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">0,2%<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr style=\"padding:0px; border:0px; outline:none 0px; vertical-align:top; background:transparent\">\n\t\t\t<td bgcolor=\"#fef5e3\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"190\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">K&uuml;lf&ouml;ldi&nbsp;<font color=\"#000000\"><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; vertical-align: top; background: transparent;\">megb&iacute;z&aacute;si d&iacute;j (amerikai OTC &eacute;s n&eacute;met region&aacute;lis piacokon v&eacute;grehajtott megb&iacute;z&aacute;sok eset&eacute;n)&nbsp;<\/font><\/font><\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fcf0d7\" class=\"tablerow\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"297\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">1%, min. 19.000 Ft<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr style=\"padding:0px; border:0px; outline:none 0px; vertical-align:top; background:transparent\">\n\t\t\t<td bgcolor=\"#f3f6f9\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"190\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">Luxembourgi tőzsd&eacute;re bevezetett, HU karakterrel kezdődő ISIN k&oacute;ddal rendelkező &eacute;rt&eacute;kpap&iacute;rok bizom&aacute;nyosi v&eacute;tele &eacute;s elad&aacute;sa&nbsp;<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#e5ecf3\" class=\"tablerow\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"297\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">1%, min. 45.000 Ft&nbsp;<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr style=\"padding:0px; border:0px; outline:none 0px; vertical-align:top; background:transparent\">\n\t\t\t<td bgcolor=\"#f3f6f9\" class=\"tablerow\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"190\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">K&uuml;lf&ouml;ldi&nbsp;megb&iacute;z&aacute;si d&iacute;j (NYSE, XETRA, NASDAQ, Nyugat-Eur&oacute;pai piacok eset&eacute;n)<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#e5ecf3\" class=\"tablerow\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"30\" style=\"border:0.08333em solid #ffffff; background:#e9e9e9; padding:1.66667em; vertical-align:top\" width=\"297\"><span style=\"outline:none 0px\">0,7%, min. 10.000 Ft<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>A r&eacute;szletes Befektet&eacute;si szolg&aacute;ltat&aacute;si d&iacute;jjegyz&eacute;k az oldal alj&aacute;n, a kapcsol&oacute;d&oacute; dokumentumokn&aacute;l tal&aacute;lhat&oacute;.<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Trader kedvezm&eacute;ny<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p>Nagy forgalmat bonyol&iacute;t &eacute;s szeretne automatikusan ennek megfelelő, kedvező d&iacute;jak mellett online tőzsd&eacute;zni?<\/p>\n\n<p>2007. augusztus 1-től &eacute;rv&eacute;nyes Trader kedvezm&eacute;ny&uuml;nk &eacute;rtelm&eacute;ben kedvezm&eacute;nyes jutal&eacute;kd&iacute;jat sz&aacute;m&iacute;tunk fel az eBrokeren kereszt&uuml;l megadott B&Eacute;T-es r&eacute;szv&eacute;ny&uuml;gyletekre (0,2%, min. 150 Ft, illetve day trade eset&eacute;n 0,1%, min.150 Ft), ha egy napt&aacute;ri negyed&eacute;vben az &Ouml;n B&Eacute;T- es prompt r&eacute;szv&eacute;nypiaci forgalma el&eacute;ri az 1.500.000.000 Ft-ot. Teljes&iacute;t&eacute;s eset&eacute;n az &uacute;j kedvezm&eacute;ny be&aacute;ll&iacute;t&aacute;sra ker&uuml;l a k&ouml;vetkező napt&aacute;ri negyed&eacute;vre. A kedvezm&eacute;ny visszavon&aacute;sig &eacute;rv&eacute;nyes &eacute;s b&aacute;rmely d&iacute;jcsomaghoz v&aacute;laszthat&oacute;.<\/p>\n\n<p>R&eacute;szletek&eacute;rt k&eacute;rj&uuml;k n&eacute;zze meg a bank hat&aacute;lyos kond&iacute;ci&oacute;s list&aacute;j&aacute;t!<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>CIBEZZ kedvezm&eacute;ny<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p>M&eacute;g nem m&uacute;lt&aacute;l el 26 &eacute;ves &eacute;s van di&aacute;kod?<\/p>\n\n<p>Ez esetben sz&aacute;modra kedvezm&eacute;nyes sz&aacute;mlavezet&eacute;st biztos&iacute;tunk (elengedj&uuml;k a 330 Ft./h&oacute; sz&aacute;mlavezet&eacute;si d&iacute;jat), valamint a Budapesti &Eacute;rt&eacute;ktőzsd&eacute;re adott megb&iacute;z&aacute;sok teljes&uuml;l&eacute;se eset&eacute;n is kedvezm&eacute;nyes jutal&eacute;kd&iacute;jat sz&aacute;m&iacute;tunk fel (0,4%, min. 150 Ft., illetve day trade eset&eacute;n 0,2%, min.150 Ft.). A kedvezm&eacute;ny akkor vehető ig&eacute;nybe, ha a bankfi&oacute;kban &eacute;rv&eacute;nyes n&eacute;vre sz&oacute;l&oacute; nappali tagozatos di&aacute;kigazolv&aacute;nyt fel tudsz mutatni, &eacute;s m&eacute;g nem m&uacute;lt&aacute;l el 26 &eacute;ves. A kedvezm&eacute;ny b&aacute;rmely eBroker d&iacute;jcsomaghoz v&aacute;laszthat&oacute;.<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>CIB K&aacute;rty&aacute;z&oacute; sz&aacute;mlacsomagok<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p>A CIB K&aacute;rty&aacute;z&oacute; Sz&aacute;mlacsomagokat azon lakoss&aacute;gi &uuml;gyfelek r&eacute;sz&eacute;re aj&aacute;nljuk, akik ak&iacute;tvan haszn&aacute;lj&aacute;k v&aacute;s&aacute;rl&aacute;saik sor&aacute;n bankk&aacute;rty&aacute;ikat valamint otthonukb&oacute;l vagy munkahely&uuml;kről, a bankfi&oacute;kok nyitva tart&aacute;s&aacute;t&oacute;l f&uuml;ggetlen&uuml;l szeretik int&eacute;zni p&eacute;nz&uuml;gyeiket alacsony sz&aacute;mlavezet&eacute;si &eacute;s tranzakci&oacute;s d&iacute;jak mellett, illetve olyan szolg&aacute;ltat&aacute;st keresnek, mely seg&iacute;ts&eacute;g&eacute;vel biztons&aacute;gosan int&eacute;zhetik internetes v&aacute;s&aacute;rl&aacute;saikat. &nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>A sz&aacute;mlacsomagokban foglalt szolg&aacute;ltat&aacute;sokat havi, illetve &eacute;ves d&iacute;j n&eacute;lk&uuml;l veheti ig&eacute;nybe.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\t<li>A CIB Internetk&aacute;rtya &eacute;s az elk&uuml;l&ouml;n&iacute;tett k&aacute;rtyasz&aacute;mla seg&iacute;ts&eacute;g&eacute;vel biztons&aacute;gosan v&aacute;s&aacute;rolhat az interneten.<\/li>\n\t<li>A CIB Mobilbank k&aacute;rtyafigyelő szolg&aacute;ltat&aacute;ssal biztons&aacute;gosan haszn&aacute;lhatja k&aacute;rty&aacute;j&aacute;t.<\/li>\n\t<li>J&ouml;vedelem- vagy megtakar&iacute;t&aacute;si felt&eacute;tel teljes&iacute;t&eacute;se n&eacute;lk&uuml;l cs&ouml;kkentheti banki k&ouml;lts&eacute;geit.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p>Mindezek mellett d&iacute;jmentesen veheti ig&eacute;nybe CIB K&aacute;rty&aacute;z&oacute; M&eacute;dium vagy CIB K&aacute;rty&aacute;z&oacute; Maximum v&aacute;laszt&aacute;sa eset&eacute;n a Classic t&iacute;pus&uacute; befektet&eacute;si sz&aacute;ml&aacute;t &eacute;s a hozz&aacute; kapcsol&oacute;d&oacute; eBroker szolg&aacute;ltat&aacute;st.<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><em>* Mag&aacute;nbefektetői csomag v&aacute;laszt&aacute;sa eset&eacute;n, adott napt&aacute;ri f&eacute;l&eacute;vben az eBroker rendszeren 150 milli&oacute; forintos f&eacute;l&eacute;vi belf&ouml;ldi r&eacute;szv&eacute;nyforgalom eset&eacute;n - a f&eacute;l&eacute;vet k&ouml;vetően, sz&aacute;mlaj&oacute;v&aacute;&iacute;r&aacute;s form&aacute;j&aacute;ban- az addig vissza nem t&eacute;r&iacute;tett, adott f&eacute;l&eacute;vre vonatkoz&oacute; szolg&aacute;ltat&aacute;si d&iacute;j is visszat&eacute;r&iacute;t&eacute;s&eacute;re ker&uuml;l.<\/em><\/p>\n\n<p><em>A jelen kond&iacute;ci&oacute;s lista a CIB Bank Zrt. (1024 Budapest, Petrezselyem utca 2-8., a tov&aacute;bbiakban: CIB), valamint fi&oacute;kjai, &uuml;gyn&ouml;ks&eacute;gei &eacute;s &uuml;gyn&ouml;kei &aacute;ltal befektet&eacute;si szolg&aacute;ltat&aacute;si &eacute;s kieg&eacute;sz&iacute;tő befektet&eacute;si szolg&aacute;ltat&aacute;si tev&eacute;kenys&eacute;g&uuml;k keret&eacute;ben felsz&aacute;m&iacute;tott &aacute;ltal&aacute;nos d&iacute;jakat tartalmazza. Az CIB fenntartja mag&aacute;nak a jogot, hogy az egyes szerződ&eacute;sek d&iacute;jait azok mennyis&eacute;gi &eacute;s minős&eacute;gi jellemzőitől f&uuml;ggően egyedileg &aacute;llap&iacute;tsa meg. Az &iacute;gy meg&aacute;llap&iacute;tott d&iacute;jak azonban - az &uuml;gyf&eacute;llel k&ouml;t&ouml;tt kifejezetten ellent&eacute;tes, &iacute;r&aacute;sbeli meg&aacute;llapod&aacute;s hi&aacute;ny&aacute;ban - az al&aacute;bb felsoroltakn&aacute;l magasabbak nem lehetnek. A lista nem tartalmazza az egyedi szerződ&eacute;seken alapul&oacute; szolg&aacute;ltat&aacute;sok ( pl. tan&aacute;csad&aacute;s ) egyedi meg&aacute;llapod&aacute;s t&aacute;rgy&aacute;t k&eacute;pező d&iacute;jt&eacute;teleit. A CIB fenntartja a kond&iacute;ci&oacute;s lista egyes t&eacute;telei, egy vagy t&ouml;bb r&eacute;sze, ill. eg&eacute;sze egyoldal&uacute; megv&aacute;ltoztat&aacute;s&aacute;nak jog&aacute;t. A felt&uuml;ntetett d&iacute;jak mentesek az &aacute;ltal&aacute;nos forgalmi ad&oacute; al&oacute;l.&nbsp;<\/em><\/p>\n"
        }
      }
      ,
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Gyakran feltett kérdések",
